WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.140 line:73%
Grid-tied, hybrid, o
off-grid: alin ang para sa'yo?

c02
00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:07.260 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:11.440 line:73%
Grid-tied: solar at grid ang
magkatuwang, walang battery.

c04
00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:15.710 line:73%
Kapag brownout, kusa itong
namamatay para sa safety.

c05
00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.320 line:73%
Hybrid: may battery, pero
depende sa setup ang backup.

c06
00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:25.350 line:73%
Off-grid: walang grid,
battery ang sandalan sa gabi.

c07
00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.320 line:73%
Kaya hindi pare-pareho
ang backup ng tatlo.

c08
00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:33.510 line:73%
Itanong muna: anong loads
ang kailangan sa brownout?

cz1
00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:38.740 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:41.490 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
